{"id":"4605b533-b398-4a6f-bf06-039295e1b046","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:25:44.766Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Aus der unten dargestellten Figur wurden zwei Kreise mit Durchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ausgeschnitten. Die Figur hat folgende Maße: "},{"type":"math","src":"h","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" = 30 cm, "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" = 20 cm, "},{"type":"math","src":"l","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" = 45 cm, "},{"type":"math","src":"b","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" = 55 cm. Berechne den Flächeninhalt der Figur. Runde das Ergebnis auf ganze Zahlen."}]}],"id":"8761cc27-457c-4c37-a9ca-e7f96bc59f26"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f5f33ba52cf2_d6b637357b092cad251394986cf71565524f7364.PNG","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"be00b94d-f8cf-422d-a463-8a24c5ff4325"}},"id":"09016c8d-49a7-477d-ae61-2248b5a3d02d"}],"id":"31cce707-9a08-49df-b727-c2294f9d3f3e"},"interactive":{"plugin":"inputExercise","state":{"type":"input-number-exact-match-challenge","unit":"cm²","answers":[{"value":"2672","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"39523625-7202-4c59-bd39-90a33d399413"}},{"value":"2672cm^2","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"edebc66e-618b-4d67-8ce2-7fc7db0f70e9"}},{"value":"2672cm²","isCorrect":true,"feedback":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Richtig! Gut!"}]}],"id":"07244d2f-c420-4dce-8b56-ecd1e74b801f"}}]},"id":"97967e96-10a6-44f6-8dda-04b706f94b8a"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"154847","title":"Zusammengesetzte Figuren"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"985c3105-9b46-4287-b4ae-c0f5a35a0621"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der erste Schritt besteht darin, die allgemeine Formel zum Flächeninhalt der zusammengesetzten Figur aufzustellen. Diese Figur besteht aus einem "},{"type":"a","href":"51490","children":[{"text":"Dreieck"}]},{"text":" und einem "},{"type":"a","href":"1697","children":[{"text":"Rechteck"}]},{"text":" aus dem zwei gleich große "},{"type":"a","href":"1553","children":[{"text":"Kreise"}]},{"text":" ausgeschnitten wurden. Das bedeutet, dass die Kreise vom Flächeninhalt des Rechtecks abgezogen werden müssen."}]}],"id":"29baf1f2-a3b1-4f44-8ec3-e4cfb1c4b94f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl} A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& (\textcolor{009999}{A_{\mathrm{Rechteck}}} &-& 2 \cdot \textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} ) &+& \textcolor{cc0000}{A_{\mathrm{Dreieck}}} \\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& (\textcolor{009999}{b \cdot l} &-& 2 \cdot \textcolor{660099}{\pi r^2}) &+& \textcolor{cc0000}{\dfrac{1}{2} \cdot b \cdot h} \\
 \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"b6125b0b-92df-42c1-9f37-f838a8062c67"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Am einfachsten ist es, die Flächeninhalte der einzelnen Teile zu berechnen und dann in die allgemeine Formel einzusetzen."}]}],"id":"d64d54f5-07c3-43a3-a07e-91f0384ceda1"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f5f4acd7fd6b_c48dd25b010c12dc2c767d5fc3b9d844557489f3.PNG","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"9e773a0d-137a-4a95-b7d7-9371b123c70b"}},"id":"aa0ab06b-39fa-4510-aa09-e4469103fc01"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}  
\textcolor{009999}{A_{\mathrm{Rechteck}}} &=& \textcolor{009999}{b \cdot l} \\
\textcolor{009999}{A_{\mathrm{Rechteck}}} &=& 55 \,\mathrm{cm} \cdot 45 \,\mathrm{cm} = 2475 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"4c9c2c8d-798d-408b-b3cd-a887dfabdaf6"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Im nächsten Schritt musst du den Flächeninhalt des Kreises ausrechnen:"}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}  
\textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} &=& \textcolor{660099}{\pi r^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"b6da80a5-6bc2-471a-896e-4bc69afdc2a1"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f5f4af47219c_4891a420c9aeb200da18a06eb9d70fb6b6afbfa5.PNG","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"531375a2-4718-4db7-80cf-a1237535926a"}},"id":"eb004b99-2a83-408b-a43b-6e4840e8ccbd"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Da der Durchmesser gegeben ist, musst du den Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" ersetzen mit:"}]}],"id":"2038240c-5b53-4914-84af-048287392d72"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"d = 2r \Rightarrow r = \dfrac{d}{2}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"89bc2891-5ee6-4e87-b346-1331d04c4091"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}  
\textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} &=& \textcolor{660099}{\pi r^2} \\\\
\textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} &=& \textcolor{660099}{\pi\cdot \Big(\dfrac{d}{^2}\Big)^2} \\\\
\textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} &=& \pi \cdot \Big(\dfrac{20 \,\mathrm{cm}}{2}\Big)^2 &=& \pi \cdot (10 \,\mathrm{cm})^2 \\\\
\textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} &=& \pi \cdot 100 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"fff419ea-4b7d-4043-8737-8f866d1abbf6"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Abschließend ist es notwendig den Flächeninhalt des Dreiecks zu ermitteln."}]}],"id":"b27fb02c-92c0-47f8-8bf9-9f4e94590da9"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5f5f4b0a4df93_806c11828b6cbc9d89edfe986fdbbe491faee7f2.PNG","caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"0734ccf1-5fd4-4ca7-968f-c5e51aa93c74"}},"id":"cf642e3b-0ae1-4d12-961d-151da621d9f4"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}  
\textcolor{cc0000}{A_{\mathrm{Dreieck}}} &=& \textcolor{cc0000}{\dfrac{1}{2} \cdot b \cdot h} \\\\
\textcolor{cc0000}{A_{\mathrm{Dreieck}}} &=& \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot 55 \,\mathrm{cm} \cdot 30 \,\mathrm{cm} = 825 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
  \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"89a3a76c-762c-4646-a463-10752ce68404"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun kannst du diese Werte in die allgemeine Formel einsetzen:"}]}],"id":"c85d9cb4-d66c-451e-808d-afce23af535e"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl} A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& (\textcolor{009999}{A_{\mathrm{Rechteck}}} &-& 2 \cdot \textcolor{660099}{A_{\mathrm{Kreis}}} ) &+& \textcolor{cc0000}{A_{\mathrm{Dreieck}}} \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& (\textcolor{009999}{b \cdot l} &-& 2 \cdot \textcolor{660099}{\pi r^2}) &+& \textcolor{cc0000}{\dfrac{1}{2} \cdot b \cdot h} \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& (2475 \,\mathrm{cm^2} &-& 2\cdot \pi\cdot 100 \,\mathrm{cm^2}) &+& 825 \,\mathrm{cm^2} \\\\
A_{\mathrm{gesamt}} &=& 2672 \,\mathrm{cm^2}
 \end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"08904374-1b1f-460b-9993-89195abdf92e"}],"id":"7c1d8316-91a4-4e25-b562-a2c0878c6236"}},"id":"1297ae93-9c7d-49fc-ab30-7f347dd61a54"}},"id":"95715bce-bfa9-4842-b342-760754fc31db"}}
